CBFilterGrid args;event;obj;sf
⍝ Callback on changes to the filter field at the top of each form

(obj event)←2↑args
:Select event←2⊃args
:Case 'KeyPress'
    →0 ⊣ eNQ (1001@2)args ⍝ Enqueue after the event, to pick up the modified Text
:Case 1001
    sf←obj↑⍨¯1+3⍳⍨+\'.'='SubForm' findParent obj ⍝ First 3 segments, i.e. F1.TC.Work
    doFilterGrid sf ⍝ Change displayed contents of the grid
:EndSelect
